{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id482218582"}, "name":{"label":"Redheaded Step Goddess"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-01T07:43:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.94.10"}, "id":{"label":"14615209269"}, "title":{"label":"Fun, cute, feeds the AuDHD"}, "content":{"label":"I’m not someone who enjoys drinking water but when I found this app, I thought “OK I’ll give it a try”. What a fun, cute way to get my brain a little dopey mean while reminding me to take care of myself. 💓🙌\n\nThe reminders are great, especially with my AuDHD. I forget to drink throughout the day and by bedtime. I definitely don’t wanna be going down water to catch up! Between liquid IV and cute little apps like this staying hydrated feels a little bit more doable so yay for. 🎉\n\nI’m giving it four stars because I wish the free trial lasted a full week instead of only three days for an app meant to help build a daily habit. Three days is not long enough to know whether the novelty will turn into something that sticks. A week would give me more confidence and deciding whether to pay.\n\nI did purchase it and I really hope I keep using-that it becomes a lovely little investment in my health rather than a short-lived moment of cuteness.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
